{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Islantiles is a cozy roguelike deck builder and city-puzzler with a one-of-a-kind scoring system.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634010/extras/RotatingIslandsSmall.gif?t=1746638636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On each handcrafted isle you will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Accumulate Goods</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harvest different resources like timber, ore and fruits to generate goods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Boost Production</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use synergies to boost your productivity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Generate Trade Value</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine resources into valuable luxuries to generate high trade value.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Technologies can twist, stack or even invert those three parallel scoring layers. For example, a tech might double your timber output and apply a \u00d73 multiplier to trade value - turning a modest harvest into a cascading windfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fuse up to five tech cards with your upgradeable card deck to customize your economy, then place buildings to trigger dazzling chain reactions. You have one year per island to gather enough wealth to expand to the next one, unlocking new technologies and revealing deeper strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634010/extras/Scoring.gif?t=1746638636\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Islantiles offers:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique blend of city puzzler and deck builder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relaxing and atmospheric gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Powerful synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-depth deck building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">150 unlockable technologies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100 hand crafted islands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Highscores &amp; Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Countless different strategies and builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roguelite Progression</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fail an island run: lose your current deck and technologies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep any unlocked techs permanently - and unveil new branches in your tech web.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every victory expands your options, so no two runs play the same.</p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Islantiles does NOT offer:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4X Strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Citizen Simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time Restrictions</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3634010?t=1746638636","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634010/8efcb4e6825f50d7532556a1b2309155c2df096a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746638636","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634010/675f5e21878ddd705603ac2ba01457381441a0f7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746638636","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634010/675f5e21878ddd705603ac2ba01457381441a0f7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746638636","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Islantiles is a cozy roguelike deck builder and city-puzzler with a one-of-a-kind scoring system.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634010/extras/RotatingIslandsSmall.gif?t=1746638636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On each handcrafted isle you will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Accumulate Goods</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harvest different resources like timber, ore and fruits to generate goods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Boost Production</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use synergies to boost your productivity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Generate Trade Value</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine resources into valuable luxuries to generate high trade value.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Technologies can twist, stack or even invert those three parallel scoring layers. For example, a tech might double your timber output and apply a \u00d73 multiplier to trade value - turning a modest harvest into a cascading windfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fuse up to five tech cards with your upgradeable card deck to customize your economy, then place buildings to trigger dazzling chain reactions. You have one year per island to gather enough wealth to expand to the next one, unlocking new technologies and revealing deeper strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634010/extras/Scoring.gif?t=1746638636\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Islantiles offers:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique blend of city puzzler and deck builder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relaxing and atmospheric gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Powerful synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-depth deck building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">150 unlockable technologies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100 hand crafted islands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Highscores &amp; Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Countless different strategies and builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roguelite Progression</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fail an island run: lose your current deck and technologies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep any unlocked techs permanently - and unveil new branches in your tech web.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every victory expands your options, so no two runs play the same.</p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Islantiles does NOT offer:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4X Strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Citizen Simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time Restrictions</p></li></ul>","developers":["Thunderrock Innovations"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634010/d35c5e8bf2020427add92735fbff959846bd4cd6/header.jpg?t=1746638636","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2024-2025 Thunderrock Innovations GmbH. All rights reserved. Islantiles and the Islantiles Logo are trademarks and/or registered trademarks of Thunderrock Innovations GmbH.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257136255,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136255/movie480.mp4?t=1746610687","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136255/movie_max.mp4?t=1746610687"},"name":"Islantiles Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257136255/cddc361a7d8281d47fc5d77f07e785c0bc5c96a8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746610687","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136255/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746610687","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136255/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746610687"}}],"name":"Islantiles","package_groups":[],"pc_requiremen